Route configuration	Manually configured	Learned dynamically
Route command	ip route	router rip
Route identification	S	R
Updates when topology changes	Manual updates usually required	Routes can update automatically
Best suited for	Small, stable networks	Small networks requiring dynamic routing

Result
Static routing was configured successfully using manually defined routes. RIP version 2 was configured to exchange routing information dynamically. Connectivity between the two networks was tested using ping, and the routing tables were examined to verify the routes.
